<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">
Spatially Conditioned Diffusion Policy: Learning Precise and Robust Manipulation with a Single RGB Camera</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
