<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Implementation Details</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Training Hyperparameters</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We summarize the implementation details and training hyperparameters used for SCDP in Table <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ A.1 Training Hyperparameters ‣ Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Spatially Conditioned Diffusion Policy: Learning Precise and Robust Manipulation with a Single RGB Camera" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Implementation details and hyperparameters of SCDP.</figcaption>
<div id="A1.T5.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:258.8pt;height:162.4pt;vertical-align:-79.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-74.0pt,46.4pt) scale(0.636269409521888,0.636269409521888) ;">
<table id="A1.T5.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hyperparameter</span></td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T5.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Value</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" colspan="2"><span id="A1.T5.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Training Hyperparameters</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Epochs</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">1000 (Meta-World); 3000 (Real-World, DexArt)</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Batch size</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">128</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Optimizer</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Adam</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Learning rate</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T5.2.1.6.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">1e-4</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">LR scheduler</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Cosine</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Weight decay</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T5.2.1.8.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">1e-6</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Reconstruction horizon</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">8</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" colspan="2"><span id="A1.T5.2.1.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Diffusion Head</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">U-Net dimensions</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t"><math id="A1.T5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(128,256,384)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>128,256,384</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(128,256,384)</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Noise scheduler</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">DDIM</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Denoising steps</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">100 (train); 10 (real-world inference); 16 (simulation inference)</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Prediction horizon</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">16</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Observation horizon</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">2</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Action horizon</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">8</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" colspan="2"><span id="A1.T5.2.1.17.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Multi-Scale Image Encoder</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.18" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Backbone channels</td>
<td id="A1.T5.2.1.18.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t"><math id="A1.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(64,64,128,256,512)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>128</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>256</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>512</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(64,64,128,256,512)</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T5.2.1.19" class="ltx_tr">
