</section>
<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>DexArt Benchmark</h3>

<div id="A2.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We follow the success criteria defined in the original DexArt implementation <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">2</a>]</cite>.
All evaluations are conducted on seen objects. Each rollout is evaluated for a maximum horizon of 250 steps.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Success criteria for DexArt tasks.</figcaption>
<div id="A2.T7.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:258.8pt;height:41.6pt;vertical-align:-19.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-61.3pt,9.8pt) scale(0.678343130390912,0.678343130390912) ;">
<table id="A2.T7.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A2.T7.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;"><span id="A2.T7.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Task</span></td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;"><span id="A2.T7.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Success description</span></td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;"><span id="A2.T7.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Criterion</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Laptop</td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Grasp the screen and open the lid</td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;"><span id="A2.T7.2.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">progress &gt; 0.95</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Faucet</td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Grasp the handle and rotate it by <math id="A2.T7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sim 90^{\circ}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim 90^{\circ}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;"><span id="A2.T7.2.1.3.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">openness &gt; 1.5</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Toilet</td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Grasp and open the toilet lid</td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;"><span id="A2.T7.2.1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">progress &gt; 0.95</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Bucket</td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;">Lift the bucket with a stable form-closure grasp</td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:5.0pt;padding-right:5.0pt;"><span id="A2.T7.2.1.5.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">delta_height &gt; 0.25</span></td></tr>
</table>
</span></div>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.F6" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2606.14535v1/Appendix_Visualization.png" id="A2.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:476/666;" width="476" height="666" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span><span id="A2.F6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Visualization of Spatial Conditioning.</span> SCDP extracts local visual features along the reconstructed trajectories, enabling the policy to focus on task-relevant interaction regions in broad scene images. The tool reference points are configurable across experimental settings; we use the palm point for DexArt and the gripper tool center point for Meta-World, as illustrated in Fig. <a href="#S3.F2" title="Figure 2 ‣ 3 Method ‣ Spatially Conditioned Diffusion Policy: Learning Precise and Robust Manipulation with a Single RGB Camera" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
