<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.1 </span>Real-World Setup</h3>

<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use a Franka Emika Panda robot equipped with a parallel gripper and a single Intel RealSense D435i camera for visual observations. Expert demonstrations were collected via human teleoperation using a Force Dimension Omega.7 device. The dataset comprises 180 demonstrations for <span id="A3.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">USB Insertion</span>, 90 for <span id="A3.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Battery Insertion</span>, 120 for <span id="A3.SS1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Long-Horizon</span>, and 50 for each remaining task. For the <span id="A3.SS1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">USB Insertion</span> task, the hub port was placed at its initial position, and the USB drive pose was randomized within a radius of 5 cm. For the <span id="A3.SS1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Battery Insertion</span> task, the battery slot was randomized along the black line shown in Fig. <a href="#S4.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ 4.3 Ablation Study ‣ 4 Simulation Experiments ‣ Spatially Conditioned Diffusion Policy: Learning Precise and Robust Manipulation with a Single RGB Camera" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>. For all remaining tasks, the target objects and distractors were randomly placed within the <math id="A3.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="30\,\mathrm{cm}\times 20\,\mathrm{cm}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>cm</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">30\,\mathrm{cm}\times 20\,\mathrm{cm}</annotation></semantics></math> workspace shown in Fig. <a href="#A3.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ C.1 Real-World Setup ‣ Appendix C Supplementary Materials: Real-World Experiments ‣ Spatially Conditioned Diffusion Policy: Learning Precise and Robust Manipulation with a Single RGB Camera" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.F7" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2606.14535v1/Appendix_Real_Environment.png" id="A3.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/324;" width="476" height="324" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span><span id="A3.F7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Real-World Experimental Setup.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
